    (Work.Spaces.HkSq α 6 (Work.FTS.StrongEps.ClassCRHS.NBlk α w Φs Φg 4)
        ≤ K * (1 + Work.Spaces.HkSq α 7 w) + K * (1 + Work.Spaces.HkSq α 6 w) ^ 2) ∧
